---
import NavigationBar from "../components/NavigationBar";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/global.css";
import Footer from "../components/Footer";
---

<Layout>
  <NavigationBar client:load />

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto mt-20 px-6 md:px-0 space-y-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <section class="space-y-4 text-gray-800">
      <p>
        Your privacy is important to us. This policy explains what data we
        collect and how we use it.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you submit forms (e.g., quote requests), we collect your name,
        email address, phone number, company, and any message you provide.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We use your data to respond to inquiries, process orders, and improve
        our services. We will not share your personal information with third
        parties except as required by law or to fulfill your request (e.g.,
        shipping labels).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">3. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep your information for as long as necessary to provide the
        requested services and comply with legal obligations.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">4. Security</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect your data from unauthorized
        access or disclosure, but no system is 100% secure.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">5. Your Choices</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal
        data by emailing us at <a
          href="mailto:owner@elliottpromotional.ca"
          class="underline">owner@elliottpromotional.ca</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The “Last updated”
        date at the top will reflect any changes.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>

  <Footer client:load />
</Layout>
